 is or it could be changed into 'as long as they touch the same forest ground' instead of carrying a decaying piece of tree. Depends on the playstyle at your table.<br /> <br /> A honorable mention would go to the gift Dumpster Diving, which isn't a direct trait of the Trashheap Totem but local teleportation trough delving into the ground and reemerging in another part of the forest might be worth consideration as one of the potential powers this Forest Floor Totem could grant if it's the Caern Totem.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is all a super clever idea, and I'm in love with it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/448972/Hearthbound-Tribe-Supplement?affiliate_id=4046720\" target=\"_blank\">Hearthbound</a> and Project Director for <a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/songoftrillium/729204622290550784/likes-dont-increase-visibility-to-others-please\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf: the Essentials</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27167-mundusartis","name":"mundusartis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27167_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-16T13:01:56-07:00","id":1486663,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>voidshaper;n1486143.[*</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mushroom hyphae can grow huge and deep. Oregon famously hosts a species that covers four square miles with a single specimen (<i>Armillaria ostoyae</i>). The spirit could have great awareness and agency over its domain. Maybe the caern is located within the decaying forest floor, with the hyphae of the fungus forming a cave.</div> </div> </div> </div>Damn, you just beated me to it. I thought exactly about that as soon as the &quot;fungi spirit&quot; was brought out. Indeed, such a creature - being the largest living being of planet Earth - could house an insanely powerful spirit with an insane level of mastery over its domains. Such creature could be used to great effect to put the old idea of &quot;powerful ancient oaks&quot; to shame.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24689-kakost","name":"Kakost","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-17T19:00:05-07:00","id":1486825,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kakost</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1486141-primordial-forest-spirits?p=1486663#post1486663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Indeed, such a creature - being the largest living being of planet Earth - could house an insanely powerful spirit with an insane level of mastery over its domains. Such creature could be used to great effect to put the old idea of &quot;powerful ancient oaks&quot; to shame.</div> </div> </div> </div>Truly. Entire forests of fungus with fruiting bodies the size and height of tree trunks called prototaxites existed long before trees did.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>voidshaper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1486141-primordial-forest-spirits?p=1486147#post1486147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's a type of tree mushroom called <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Auricularia_auricula-judae\" target=\"_blank\">Wood Ear</a> or Jelly Ear that would make a good replacement focus item.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>That's perfect. Imagining that those this fungus 'chooses' to recognize has the mushroom grow on their body somewhere overnight.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/448972/Hearthbound-Tribe-Supplement?affiliate_id=4046720\" target=\"_blank\">Hearthbound</a> and Project Director for <a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/songoftrillium/729204622290550784/likes-dont-increase-visibility-to-others-please\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf: the Essentials</a>","edited":{"userid":27167,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27167-mundusartis","user":"mundusartis","date":".  replying to a second person 07-17-2022, 10:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27167-mundusartis","name":"mundusartis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27167_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T15:49:16-07:00","id":1487265,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mundusartis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1486141-primordial-forest-spirits?p=1486825#post1486825\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Truly. Entire forests of fungus with fruiting bodies the size and height of tree trunks called prototaxites existed long before trees did.</div> </div> </div> </div>Now I'm picturing that landscape in Morrowind.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4674-ammayhem","name":"AMmayhem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4674_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T17:48:10-07:00","id":1487286,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AMmayhem</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1486141-primordial-forest-spirits?p=1487265#post1487265\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Now I'm picturing that landscape in Morrowind.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hello fellow ESIII fan! They're very similar! In this case it's more like a forest of cordyceps-like trunks rising in massive columns that have a blunt end like a finger, rather than eliminate in a cap. Wish I could post photos hahaha but do a google images search for prototaxite landscape. The earth was a very alien world when fungus ruled.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/448972/Hearthbound-Tribe-Supplement?affiliate_id=4046720\" target=\"_blank\">Hearthbound</a> and Project Director for <a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/songoftrillium/729204622290550784/likes-dont-increase-visibility-to-others-please\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf: the Essentials</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27167-mundusartis","name":"mundusartis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27167_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}